{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":82,"count":33,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L08-1-12\",\"百貨公司\",\"百貨公司\",\"百货公司\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"知道，百貨公司都有，不難找。","pinyin":"Zhīdào, bǎihuògōngsī dōu yǒu, bù nán zhǎo.","english":"Yes. I think you can get them in department stores; it is not too difficult to find.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"鞋子都在一樓，我們到樓下去吧！九點了，百貨公司快要關了。","pinyin":"Xiézi dōu zài yì lóu, wǒmen dào lóuxià qù ba! Jiǔ diǎn le, bǎihuògōngsī kuàiyào guān le.","english":"All the shoes are on the first floor. Let’s go downstairs. It’s 9:00; the department store is closing soon.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"百貨公司裡有很多衣服、鞋子和皮包，都是最新的，所以很多年輕女生喜歡到百貨公司去，漂亮的、流行的衣服，她們都想穿穿看。","pinyin":"Bǎihuògōngsī lǐ yǒu hěn duō yīfu, xiézi hé píbāo, dōu shì zuì xīn de, suǒyǐ hěn duō niánqīng nǚshēng xǐhuān dào bǎihuògōngsī qù, piàoliang de, liúxíng de yīfu, tāmen dōu xiǎng chuānchuān kàn.","english":"Clothes, shoes and purses in department stores are all the latest; therefore, many young ladies like to go there and try on both beautiful and trendy items.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"百(hundred) + 貨(products) + 公司(company) → a company with hundreds of products: department store."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-11\",\"差不多\",\"差不多\",\"差不多\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:你每天幾點起床？ B:差不多七點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-11","sourceFront":"差不多","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我爸爸是老師，他很喜歡他的工作。他在餐廳工作，每天差不多都晚上十點回家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-01","sourceFront":"工作","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從中部坐車到南部去，差不多要兩個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-13","sourceFront":"中部","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他喜歡玩手機遊戲，差不多每天玩兩個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-12","sourceFront":"遊戲","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的房租每個月一萬塊，加上水費、電費，差不多一萬三。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-22","sourceFront":"加上","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我跟室友的個性、興趣都差不多，所以我們是好朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-02","sourceFront":"差不多","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得「害怕」跟「可怕」的意思差不多，所以常弄錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-19","sourceFront":"弄錯","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"美國的一毛錢差不多是台灣的三塊錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-11","sourceFront":"毛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台灣的夏天，差不多五點鐘天就亮了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-21","sourceFront":"亮","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"去年台灣冬天的溫度很低，差不多五度，冷得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-19","sourceFront":"度","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們的成長經驗、教育背景都差不多，所以想法也很像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-22","sourceFront":"背景","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說天上的一天，差不多是人間的好幾十年","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-13","sourceFront":"人間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"差(difference) + 不(no) + 多(much): the difference is not much, so it's about/approximately."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-01\",\"喂\",\"喂\",\"喂\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"喂，請問王宜文小姐在嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-01","sourceFront":"喂","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) with no 畏(fear) calls into the phone → one warm 喂(hello)."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-3-04\",\"荷蘭\",\"荷蘭\",\"荷兰\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次去荷蘭旅行的費用很高，因為車票很貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-24","sourceFront":"費用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆去歐洲旅遊回來，買了荷蘭傳統的點心送給大家，叫我們去助理那裡領。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-05","sourceFront":"領","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"荷蘭(Hélán) sounds like 'Holland' → a transliteration; 荷(lotus) and 蘭(orchid) are just the sounds."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-06\",\"最好\",\"最好\",\"最好\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"秋天的天氣最好，不冷也不熱。","pinyin":"Qiūtiān de tiānqì zuì hǎo, bù lěng yě bú rè.","english":"The weather is the best in autumn, not too cold and not too hot.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-01","sourceFront":"夏天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-21\",\"貿易\",\"貿易\",\"贸易\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家貿易公司跟美國做生意，職員都得會說英文。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-21","sourceFront":"貿易","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國與美國之間的貿易問題很嚴重，這個新聞早就上電視了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-14","sourceFront":"上","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-2-19\",\"聽見\",\"聽見\",\"听见\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我聽見樓下有奇怪的聲音，是不是有小偷啊？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-19","sourceFront":"聽見","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"當周圍環境很靜的時候，可以聽見平常聽不到的聲音。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-45","sourceFront":"靜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在大都市，早上起床能聽見鳥叫聲，那真是太難得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-36","sourceFront":"聲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽見他欣賞的那位歌星來演唱的消息，令他興奮地跳了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-38","sourceFront":"演唱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我聽見有人在敲門，你去看看是誰來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-15","sourceFront":"敲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這位郵差的聲音很大，每次他來送信，整條街全都聽見了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-41","sourceFront":"郵差","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-2-07\",\"鬆餅\",\"鬆餅\",\"松饼\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王老闆舉辦了一個免費吃鬆餅的活動，目的是調查哪種口味的鬆餅最受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-10","sourceFront":"調查","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-35\",\"留\",\"留\",\"留\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"出國留學有很多好處，除了學習語言，還有文化交流的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-23","sourceFront":"交流","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他很勇敢，十五歲就離開父母，一個人到英國去留學了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-07","sourceFront":"離開","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"陳可欣的舅舅和舅媽都在日本留過學，所以日語說得很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-27","sourceFront":"舅舅","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"要是你想出國留學，一定得加強外語能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-16","sourceFront":"加強","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他去過德國留學，難怪會說德文。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-30","sourceFront":"難怪","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"孩子出國留學以後，父母發現孩子成長了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他的成績很好，有機會得到出國留學的獎學金。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-13","sourceFront":"得到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你畢業後要出國留學或是留在國內工作，都是不錯的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-17","sourceFront":"國內","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"花蓮的風景很美，我想多留兩天，慢慢地看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-16","sourceFront":"留","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"王先生年輕時去過英國留學，所以英文說得不錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-10","sourceFront":"時","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他想多了解一點兒台灣文化，所以決定來台灣留學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-10","sourceFront":"了解","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我打算明年到美國去留學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-39","sourceFront":"留學","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"如果他不能接電話，你就留言吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-08","sourceFront":"留言","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"不管出國工作或留學，一定得買個平安保險，萬一發生什麼意外才能得到幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-34","sourceFront":"意外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大寶明年有去英國留學的打算，所以找了家庭教師幫他補習， 希望提高英文程度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-07","sourceFront":"補習班","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外留學的時候，小史是我最好的兄弟，我們總是互相照顧、互相幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-01","sourceFront":"兄弟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我到德國留學的頭兩個星期，因為對環境不環境而迷過幾次路，後來就沒問題了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-21","sourceFront":"熟悉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你知道辦理留學的手續需要準備哪些資料嗎？ B:我不清楚。你可以上網查查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-04","sourceFront":"辦理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"打仗期間，許多軍人為國家犧牲了寶貴的生命，也給家人留下了痛苦的記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-14","sourceFront":"打仗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國留學有不少好處，例如打開視野、增加自信、提高外文程度等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-20","sourceFront":"例如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"畢業當天，許多學生帶著攝影機在校園裡攝影，留下了珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-13","sourceFront":"攝影","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想當年，出國留學的日子雖然很忙，卻很充實","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-17","sourceFront":"日子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那部電影沒有結局，是導演要留給觀眾想像的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-32","sourceFront":"結局","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這支手錶是我過世的爺爺留給我的，對我來說具有特別的意義","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-07","sourceFront":"具有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少博物館裡的藝術品都是從古代保留到現代的，具有重要的時代意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-21","sourceFront":"保留","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有圖畫，沒有文字的故事書 ，能夠留給兒童想像及思考的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-10","sourceFront":"圖畫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"窗外正下著大雨，我又沒帶傘，看來得在公司多留一會兒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-29","sourceFront":"看來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去英國留學時，常利用週末到旅行社打工，帶觀光客到著名的景點觀光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-31","sourceFront":"觀光客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生活忙碌的時候，也要給自己留一些休息時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-03","sourceFront":"忙碌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自殺或許能令個人不再受到痛苦，但卻把痛苦留給了身邊的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-04","sourceFront":"自殺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"申請留學的過程中，最讓人操心的可能就是寫讀書計畫了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-31","sourceFront":"操心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這只箱子是以前奶奶留給我的，對我來說是很珍貴的禮物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-36","sourceFront":"只","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"錢小姐戴的那副耳環就像星光一樣美麗，聽說那是祖母留給她的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-41","sourceFront":"耳環","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人覺得留鬍子比較帥，我倒是覺得留了鬍子看起來比較老。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-06","sourceFront":"鬍子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他因為生活條件的限制，而放棄了出國留學的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-04","sourceFront":"放棄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"難得出國旅行，一定要多照幾張相片留念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-18","sourceFront":"留念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A bent figure holds a 刀(knife) at the 田(field) post → asking you to 留(stay)."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-12\",\"深\",\"深\",\"深\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小李今天看起來比較瘦，可能是因為穿了深色衣服的關係","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-12","sourceFront":"深","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我妹妹剛學會游泳，就想游到水很深的地方，我覺得太危險了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-12","sourceFront":"深","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你們之間的誤會越來越深，要是不面對面說清楚，恐怕連朋友都當不成了","pinyin":"