日用品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"博物館內的藝術品價值都很高，不小心弄壞了可是要賠償不少錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-09","sourceFront":"賠償","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位畫家的作品，很多國內外的買家都十分感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-20","sourceFront":"買家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人利用新年期間到國外旅行，國內過年的氣氛就越來越淡了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-42","sourceFront":"氣氛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校邀請李教授來演講，內容相當精彩，讓我有很大的收穫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-30","sourceFront":"精彩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路直播的內容各種各樣，甚至有人因為直播平日生活而變成明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-13","sourceFront":"直播","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電腦展內的人太多了，大家擠來擠去的，真是受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-19","sourceFront":"擠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國內外的社會運動，經常都是因為人民的意見不被尊重而引起的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-28","sourceFront":"尊重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次座談會邀請了各領域的人們，主要目的是對國內的地方建設提一些建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-38","sourceFront":"座談會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他手上有傷，醫師建議他三日以內不要碰水，以免感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-37","sourceFront":"傷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,