:1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我跟同學常常一起在學校打網球。","pinyin":"Wǒ gēn tóngxué chángcháng yìqǐ zài xuéxiào dǎ wǎngqiú.","english":"My classmates and I often play tennis together at the school.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-03","sourceFront":"球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很簡單，上網一查就知道了。","pinyin":"Hěn jiǎndān, shàngwǎng yì chá jiù zhīdào le.","english":"It’s very simple. You can know it as soon as you check it online.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"好，我上網查查看。","pinyin":"Hǎo, wǒ shàngwǎng cháchá kàn.","english":"OK, I will do that.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我也不知道。我們可以先上網看地圖。","pinyin":"Wǒ yě bù zhīdào. Wǒmen kěyǐ xiān shàngwǎng kàn dìtú.","english":"I don’t know either. We can check the map online first.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"打網球怎麼樣？中明說妳的網球打得很好，我們一起去打吧。","pinyin":"Dǎ wǎngqiú zěnmeyàng? Zhōngmíng shuō nǐ de wǎngqiú dǎ de hěn hǎo, wǒmen yìqǐ qù dǎ ba.","english":"How about playing tennis? Zhongming said you play it well. Let’s go play it together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L13-2-26\",\"一方面\",\"一方面\",\"一方面\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個美國人每天看臺灣的連續劇，一方面學習中文，一方面了解臺灣的生活文化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-26","sourceFront":"一方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Examining 一(one) distinct 方(direction) or side of a 面(face): 一方面 means on one hand."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-30\",\"拼\",\"拼\",\"拼\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個世界拼圖很難拼，得花好幾天才拼得成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-30","sourceFront":"拼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"A 扌(hand) merges pieces with a 并(merge) motion: 拼(piece together)."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-34\",\"行动\",\"行動\",\"行动\",\"N/Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"台灣有句著名的廣告台詞「心動不如馬上行動」，意思是當個人有了想法之後，光是想是沒用的，得立刻行動才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-34","sourceFront":"行動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"行動不方便的乘客乘車時，車站有服務員為他們服務。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-03","sourceFront":"乘客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:江先生對父母很孝順，個性又溫柔，將來一定是好先生。B:這還用說嗎？要是妳對他有意思，就得早點兒行動喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-60","sourceFront":"這還用說嗎？","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-55\",\"願\",\"願\",\"愿\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"再過幾天就要過年了，在此願大家新年平安，事事如意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-55","sourceFront":"願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他願意挑戰自己的工作能力，並積極地克服挫折，真是難得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-04","sourceFront":"難得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"對我來說，幸福就是在身邊有一群願意互相幫助的好友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-38","sourceFront":"群","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我的老闆具有獨特的領導魅力， 員工都願意跟著他努力工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-07","sourceFront":"具有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"如果同事之間不願意溝通，這個會議怎麼開下去呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-21","sourceFront":"下去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"假如貴公司想擴大生產規模，可以參考本公司的作法，我們很願意提供協助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-06","sourceFront":"參考","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小藍從小在育幼院長大，最大的願望就是將來能有一個溫暖的家庭。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-29","sourceFront":"願望","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了偏僻地區孩子的教育，有十幾位老師願意上山下海，到山上、海邊的學校教書。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-38","sourceFront":"上山下海","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"經理這次願意採用新員工的建議，讓我們都嚇了一跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-18","sourceFront":"採用","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"寫劇本對我來說是個很大的挑戰，但是也能得到不少收穫，所以我願意試試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-30","sourceFront":"挑戰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個演員非常喜歡演戲，不管導演給他多麼難演的角色，他都願意試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-25","sourceFront":"多麼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家工廠的工作很辛苦，可是錢很多，所以很多人願意做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-41","sourceFront":"願意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了更有效地利用地球資源，我寧願減少不必要的生活享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-09","sourceFront":"寧願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你彈吉他彈得真不錯，如果你願意教我，我想跟你學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-39","sourceFront":"彈","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從小時候起，他的第一志願就是當一位保護國家的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-03","sourceFront":"志願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除非別人願意，否則你不該強迫其他人全按你的意見做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-45","sourceFront":"強迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天天說自己外行、不願嘗試的人，就無法更深入地瞭解世界。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-08","sourceFront":"外行","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對志工服務一向有興趣，哪怕做得又忙又累，他也願意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-34","sourceFront":"哪怕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你願意開放自己的心時， 你所見的世界也會更加地美妙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-18","sourceFront":"美妙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對發展新科技向來保守，不願接受人工智慧產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-19","sourceFront":"向來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Reflecting on the original 原(source) of one's purpose, a bowed 頁(head) harbors a heartfelt 願(desire)."},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-03\",\"歌劇\",\"歌劇\",\"歌剧\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他從音樂學院畢業以後就加入歌劇團，到世界各地表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-03","sourceFront":"歌劇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-25\",\"電臺\",\"電臺\",\"电台\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"雖然現在網路很普遍了，還是有不少人喜歡聽電臺的節目。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-25","sourceFront":"電臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-32\",\"体验\",\"體驗\",\"体验\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"觀光客都說日本四季的景色都很有特色，有機會我要親自去體驗一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-32","sourceFront":"體驗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校每學期都帶學生到郊外旅行，體驗大自然的美好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-35","sourceFront":"郊外","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"學校安排我們到鄉下當「一日農民」，體驗農夫的辛苦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-40","sourceFront":"農民","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-1-52\",\"口红\",\"口紅\",\"口红\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現代的口紅不僅使用方便，在顏色上也有不少變化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-52","sourceFront":"口紅","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-27\",\"明確\",\"明確\",\"明确\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一項計畫假如目標不明確，往往就得不到想要的結果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-27","sourceFront":"明確","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-22\",\"表情\",\"表情\",\"表情\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"表情豐富、能模仿不同人物，是演員應有的基本條件。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-22","sourceFront":"表情","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-44\",\"参与\",\"參與\",\"参与\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那位模特兒曾多次參與連續劇演出，相當受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-44","sourceFront":"參與","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在全球環境會議中，聯合國邀請了一些環保團體共同參與。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-39","sourceFront":"聯合國","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她推動學習革命，讓學生主動參與規劃課程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-01","sourceFront":"推動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-34\",\"随意\",\"隨意\",\"随意\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我旅行的方式很隨意，出發前從不先規劃行程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-34","sourceFront":"隨意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"華語書籍陳列在書架的左邊，如有興趣可隨意翻翻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-30","sourceFront":"陳列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"乾\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"十(ten) 早(early) days take their toll as a 乞(beg) for water rises → the land is 乾(arid)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"太魯閣\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"太魯閣(Truku) — the Mandarin spelling of the indigenous name → 太魯閣(Taroko)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"幾\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 戈(dagger-axe) guards a 幺(small) 人(person) counting foes → 幾(how many)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"找\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 扌(hand) takes up a 戈(dagger-axe) → to 找(look for) what's lost."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"理論\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 理(reason) and 論(debate): 理論 means theory."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"百\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 一(one) stroke crowns 白(white) paper → 百(hundred)."}]}
